MIR_STREAM_ACCT pc=262144 taken_bytes=262152 dW70=0 w70a=0 w70b=0 words0=0 words1=65538 dwords=65538 K=262152
MIR_STREAM_QUIESCE level_end=0 quiesced=1 premise_level0=1 waited_ms=0.0 settle_s=1.00 strict=1 (前提: FIFO 尾部已排空; 打包器残留由 FPGA 侧停流 flush 清)
MIR_STREAM_IDA 式A(成形器) taken_bytes - pc == shaper_resid -> 8  band=[0,32] closed_a=1
MIR_STREAM_IDB 式B(镜像/K) K - taken_bytes - dW70 == mirror_resid -> 0  band=[0,24] closed_b=1 (K 来源=--k-bytes; --resid-max 旧名未用)
